            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Centering can be done by adjusting `config.window.config` option. Here is a [direct example](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/03387f53f1cb8c6a8ba0798041c6aa3525ed11ba/doc/mini-pick.txt#L659-L669) in help file.\n\nI am not quite sure what is meant by \"margin around the window\", but I guess this is either about border. It is also controlled via `config.window.config` or global 'winborder' option.",
